00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:40,900
It's literally the same root word as hatah for sin.

420
00:29:40,900 --> 00:29:43,840
It literally means to de-sin my sin.

421
00:29:44,940 --> 00:29:49,480
So, I know we've stumbled through this, but I promise I'm going to land the plane here, all right?

