452
00:31:37,280 --> 00:31:40,180
John chapter 19, verse 28 through 30.

453
00:31:40,180 --> 00:31:49,600
Later, Jesus hanging on the cross, knowing that everything had now been finished, and so that the Scripture would be fulfilled, Jesus said, I am thirsty.

